Add --use-url-origin to JMAP import and export

After session discovery every request went to the apiUrl, uploadUrl
and downloadUrl the session advertises. A server reached over loopback
advertises its public URL, so those requests left through the public
address. With --use-url-origin the three URLs are moved onto the
origin of --url, keeping their paths and templates. The field is on
ConnectConfig, so each test literal names it.

